% mexSSAVE can be used to save biosig data in GDF and a few other formats. 
%   examples of usage are shown in demo3, demo4, demo5.
% 
%   Usage of mexSSAVE:
%	status=mexSSAVE(HDR,data)
%   Input:
%	HDR	Header structure 
%	data	data matrix, one channel per column
%	HDR	header structure
%
%	status 0: file saves successfully
%
%	status <>0: file could not saved
%
% see also: DEMO3, DEMO4, DEMO5, minidet2gdf

